WEBVTT

0
00:00:02.269 --> 00:00:03.339
Lesson part 6,

1
00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:04.670
exercise 1.

2
00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.889
Create a custom hook called use local storage

3
00:00:08.148 --> 00:00:10.869
that manages states synchronized with local storage.

4
00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:16.940
OK,

5
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:17.739
let's do it.

6
00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:18.780
First,

7
00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:19.899
open the file,

8
00:00:19.959 --> 00:00:21.290
use local storage.

9
00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:22.239
Next,

10
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:23.780
import use state

11
00:00:23.989 --> 00:00:25.700
and use effect from react.

12
00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:30.110
Now,

13
00:00:30.389 --> 00:00:32.650
create a function called use local storage

14
00:00:33.029 --> 00:00:35.869
that takes a key and an initial value as arguments.

15
00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:41.650
Inside,

16
00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:43.209
declare a state variable,

17
00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:44.169
type

18
00:00:44.569 --> 00:00:45.180
const,

19
00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:46.450
stored value,

20
00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:47.909
set stored value

21
00:00:48.069 --> 00:00:49.490
equals use state.

22
00:00:50.209 --> 00:00:52.450
We initialize the state using an arrow function.

23
00:00:53.139 --> 00:00:54.060
Inside the function,

24
00:00:54.139 --> 00:00:56.490
retrieve the stored item from local storage.

25
00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:57.400
Type

26
00:00:57.819 --> 00:00:58.930
constant item equals

27
00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:02.409
window.local storage.getite

28
00:01:02.799 --> 00:01:03.700
with key.

29
00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:05.260
If an item exists,

30
00:01:05.459 --> 00:01:08.180
parse it using Jason.pars and return it.

31
00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:09.360
Otherwise,

32
00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:11.419
return the initial value.

33
00:01:11.819 --> 00:01:12.739
If there's an error,

34
00:01:13.069 --> 00:01:15.339
catch it and return the initial value.

35
00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:17.599
Now don't forget the use effect.

36
00:01:18.059 --> 00:01:19.220
Inside use effect,

37
00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:21.040
set the local storage item

38
00:01:21.279 --> 00:01:22.959
whenever the state updates.

39
00:01:23.459 --> 00:01:24.029
Type

40
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:27.639
window.local storage.set item,

41
00:01:28.059 --> 00:01:29.040
passing the key

42
00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:30.849
and Jason.stringify

43
00:01:31.209 --> 00:01:32.300
on stored value.

44
00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:34.910
In the dependency array include key

45
00:01:35.089 --> 00:01:36.489
and stored value.

46
00:01:36.959 --> 00:01:37.480
Finally,

47
00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.300
return stored value

48
00:01:39.529 --> 00:01:41.129
and set stored value

49
00:01:41.489 --> 00:01:43.470
so they can be used outside the hook.

50
00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:44.529
That's it.

51
00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:46.099
In the next lesson,

52
00:01:46.389 --> 00:01:48.660
we will use this use local storage hook.

53
00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:49.510
Goodbye.